YTM:             0,836%
Spread (MS):     +40 BP
Spread (Govt.):  +56 BP
ISIN:            CH1593191104
Rating:          AA (S&amp;P)
Kotierung:       SIX, ab 15.09.2026
</pre><p/><p>uh/tt/cf</p>
